Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Nearly 4,000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Mesopotamians lent silver at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:05.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}20 percent interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Yet the first coins wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}appear for over a thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:10.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}years. So how did money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:11.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}The classic story says
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:15.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}people bartered, a goat for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:15.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}some grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}But no one has ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:18.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}documented a society that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}ran on barter alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Instead, Mesopotamian
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:24.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}scribes recorded debts on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:25.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}clay tablets, measured in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:27.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}silver and barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}A shekel was a weight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}of silver, about eight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:30.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:32.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}So money may have started
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:34.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}as a record of who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:34.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}owed what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:36.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Historians still debate the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:37.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}details.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Then, in the late six
