Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.05,0:00:42.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}modern Turkey, people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:44.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}stamped lumps of electrum, a
